        "gg58rzCkHY1_text": "<p>Feel clean and balanced all day long.</p>",
        "gg5_ZVQ21Jl_text": "<p><strong>My Partner Noticed FIRST!</strong></p><p>FloraFresh should be illegal because this level of freshness, confidence, and <i>let’s get it on</i> energy is just <i>unfair</i> to the rest of the world. My skin feels softer, my body feels alive, and I <i>actually want to be touched</i> again. BUY IT.</p>",
