        "ggKCKhrNz6U_text": "Verified buyer",
        "ggLWEUO38QC_text": "<p><strong>I Feel Like a Goddess Again!</strong><br>Three weeks in, and I swear my body did a <i>full refresh.</i> No more irritation, no more bad smell—just pure, all-day freshness. My confidence shot up, and let’s just say my husband is VERY thankful. 😏 FloraFresh is a game-changer!</p>",
