        "ggoqqvM-5nF_label": "<p>Unlock Offer</p>",
        "ggsi2Y1XpCf_text": "<p>Goodbye Discomfort</p>",
        "ggwkR9jTPpL_text": "<p><strong>I'm on Fire (and So Is Our Bedroom)</strong></p><p>I didn’t realize how much discomfort was holding me back. Now? I'm feeling amazing, and our intimacy has never been better. BUY IT FOR YOU, GIRLS. You’ll thank me later. 😉</p>",
